<view class="page">
  <view class="page-title">风险预警</view>
  <view class="page-subtitle">查看与您关联的提醒和处理进展。</view>

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="card" aria-role="status">正在加载提醒…</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="card">
    <view class="notice notice--danger" aria-role="alert">{{error}}</view>
    <button class="btn btn--secondary" bindtap="loadData">重新加载</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:elif="{{result && !result.context.patient}}" class="card">尚未关联患者，请联系管理员完成绑定。</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{result && !result.alerts.length}}" class="card">目前没有提醒，继续保持适合自己的练习节奏。</view>

  <view wx:for="{{result.alerts}}" wx:key="id" class="card alert alert--{{item.level}}">
    <view class="alert__head">
      <text class="badge badge--{{item.level === 'critical' ? 'danger' : item.level}}">{{item.levelLabel}}</text>
      <text class="alert__time">{{item.triggeredAt}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="card-title">请关注本次提醒</view>
    <view class="muted">当前状态：{{item.status}}</view>
    <view class="muted">通知进展：{{item.deliveries}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="notice notice--warning">
    预警处理与随访登记由照护管理员或康复治疗师在机构端完成，小程序内仅查看。
  </view>
</view>
